            <outline text="Achieving full potential" />
          </outline>
          <outline text="Transcendence / Spiritual needs">
            <outline text="Giving oneself to something beyond oneself">
              <outline text="Altruism" />
              <outline text="Spirituality" />
            </outline>
            <outline text="Desire to reach the infinite" />
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="&lt;b&gt;Visions&lt;/b&gt;">
          <outline text="I am the co-founder and co-leader of the international business integrator and business incubator corporation &quot;Canteen&quot;, where we help to bring business ideas to life and integrate them into our corporation." />
          <outline text="I am the co-founder and co-leader of an international organization that helps talented children." />
          <outline text="I am the co-founder and co-leader of an international organization that helps children, through proper upbringing and education, to create a foundation for a decent, happy, fulfilled, and successful life." />
          <outline text="I am the author of a series of books with a structured, clear, and concrete description of a happy, effective, successful life and development." />
          <outline text="I am the author of a system with a structured, clear, and concrete description of a happy, effective, successful life and development." />
          <outline text="I am the author of a project to interview happy and successful people." />
        </outline>
