            <outline text="Values">
              <outline text="Identifying Your Core Values">
                <outline text="Reflecting on life experiences (What moments have shaped who you are?)" />
                <outline text="Values clarification exercises (Ranking values, considering what matters most to you)" />
                <outline text="Examples of common values: Honesty, kindness, justice, creativity, family, ambition, environmentalism etc." />
              </outline>
              <outline text="Living in Accordance with Your Values">
                <outline text="Decision-making (Prioritizing choices that align with values)" />
                <outline text="Addressing conflicts (Resolving value dilemmas as they arise)" />
                <outline text="Setting boundaries (Protecting what's important to you)" />
              </outline>
              <outline text="Values Evolution">
                <outline text="Understanding that values can evolve over time with experience" />
              </outline>
            </outline>
            <outline text="Beliefs">
              <outline text="What Do You Believe About Yourself?">
                <outline text="Internalized beliefs about your abilities, potential, and worth." />
                <outline text="Challenging negative self-beliefs (Identifying limiting thought patterns)" />
                <outline text="Cultivating positive self-beliefs (Building self-confidence, affirmations)" />
              </outline>
              <outline text="What Do You Believe About the World?">
                <outline text="Your worldview (Fundamental assumptions about reality and how it functions)" />
                <outline text="Examining biases (Recognizing how your beliefs may shape your perceptions)" />
                <outline text="Openness to new information (Learning and adapting your beliefs)" />
              </outline>
            </outline>
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="Self-Development / Personal Growth">
          <outline text="Goal Alignment">
            <outline text="Are my current self-development efforts actively moving me closer to my overall life goals and vision?" />
            <outline text="Where might there be misalignments between my actions and desired outcomes?" />
          </outline>
          <outline text="Progress Tracking">
            <outline text="What tangible progress have I made since my last self-assessment?" />
            <outline text="Have I encountered unexpected obstacles, and what did I learn from them?" />
            <outline text="What successes should I celebrate and replicate?" />
          </outline>
          <outline text="Learning &amp; Growth">
            <outline text="Have I consistently gained new skills and knowledge relevant to my development goals?" />
            <outline text="Am I regularly applying what I learn to create tangible results?" />
            <outline text="Am I pushing myself out of my comfort zone to facilitate growth?" />
          </outline>
          <outline text="Mindset &amp; Beliefs">
            <outline text="Have I identified and worked on any limiting beliefs holding me back?" />
            <outline text="Am I cultivating a growth mindset, embracing challenges as opportunities?" />
            <outline text="How is my overall outlook – do I feel empowered or discouraged about my development path?" />
          </outline>
          <outline text="Resources &amp; Support">
            <outline text="Am I efficiently utilizing the tools, resources, and mentors available to me?" />
            <outline text="Are there untapped resources I could access to accelerate my progress?" />
            <outline text="Is my support network providing the encouragement and guidance I need?" />
          </outline>
        </outline>
        <outline text="Relationship / Partner" />
        <outline text="Family Relationships">
          <outline text="Children / Parenting ">
            <outline text="Raising Children">
              <outline text="Providing basic needs">
                <outline text="Food" />
                <outline text="Shelter" />
                <outline text="Clothing" />
                <outline text="Healthcare" />
                <outline text="Safety" />
              </outline>
